# 0.4.0 step 4 (WL restated): a summary a decision wants is produced at once and taken at the first decision after it is ready. Print
# mode, so no away timer: the cold return at req 4 produces its cut in the background; the next return finds it ready and takes it.
# The mutant hides ready summaries from the decisions (run.ts ready), so that return prices the cut again and produces it once more.
world automatic known ttl=300 true=300 survival=none c=1 sys=3000 window=200000 native print
prompt +0s
call npm 20K
say 25.7K
prompt +60s
call npm 100
say 100
prompt +330s
say 100
prompt +330s
say 100
